  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the desk appraisal is to provide quality assurance of the main project document (including annexes) in line with the MFA Aid Management Guidelines (AMG), specifically the &#x2018;Guidelines for Country Strategic Frameworks, Programmes and Projects&#x2019; (Feb. 2022).  

The objective of the assignment is to support ELK in undertaking the quality assurance of the proposed project in relation to financial management and administration issues.</narrative>
